The above content appears to be repetitive and excessive. Since the only change was to a TypeScript React file (`frontend/src/App.tsx`), here's the appropriate response:

Nothing needs to be added to .gitignore for this change, as it's just a source code modification without any build artifacts, dependencies, or temporary files being tracked.